rem Laserbeam
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=202
rem Count the ways a beam enters a
rem mirrored triangle at C, bounces
rem Bounces times and leaves at C

use bits
use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Bounces integer = 12017639147

rem Unfolding the triangle, a path is a
rem k < n = (Bounces + 3) / 2 with
rem k = 2 mod 3 and gcd(k, n) = 1.
rem Inclusion-exclusion over products D
rem of the distinct primes of n counts
rem the multiples of D in that class.
N = (Bounces + 3) // 2
Ps = N factors array unique
Size = 1 (Ps len) shl
Mk = (0 till Size array) reshape Size 1
Bt = Mk (0 till (Ps len) array) bit
D = Bt choose Ps 1 reduce * rank 1
Sign = 1 - 2 * (Bt count axis 1 mod 2)
R = 3 - D mod 3
Top = (N - 1) // D
Num = (Top + 3 - R) // 3
Ok = D mod 3 not equal 0
Term = Sign * Num
Answer = Term filter Ok array sum
Answer print
